{"created": "2026-09-23T15:36:56.710756+00:00", "modified": "2026-09-23T16:48:00.570621+00:00", "id": 22920911, "conceptrecid": "22920910", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.22920911", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.22920910", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22920911", "metadata": {"title": "Zeta 7 is Irrational", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.22920911", "publication_date": "2026-09-23", "description": "<p>We prove that &zeta;(7) is irrational. The proof constructs integer polynomials Qn of degree 37n<br>with<br>0 &lt; Qn(&zeta;(7)) &lt; exp(\ufe01<br>&minus;19000 n2)\ufe01for all sufficiently large n. These polynomials are rationally normalized Hankel determinants&nbsp;attached to a positive moment functional. A positive integral representation gives nonvanishing;a logarithmic-energy estimate with respect to an explicit comparison measure gives the real&nbsp;bound; local p-adic determinant estimates over Zp[X] control the coefficients after an explicit<br>rational normalization. A perturbation estimate also gives |&zeta;(7)&minus;a/b| &gt; b&minus;270 for every integer<br>a and all sufficiently large positive integers b.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Anand, Prince", "affiliation": null, "orcid": "0009-0004-1060-2045"}], "resource_type": {"title": "Preprint", "type": "publication", "subtype": "preprint"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "22920910"}}]}, "notes": "<p>There is a optimality mismatch error in 1.3 theorem proof particulalrly the A200 which uses -11 and gets exp(-17600n&sup2;) Refer (118). However, this still carries out the argument,but the abstract mentions exp(-19000n&sup2;) so one can easily take in -11.99 and get -19184 giving the necessary bound described. This would be fixed in v2 of the paper.</p>"}, "title": "Zeta 7 is Irrational", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22920911", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/22920911", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/22920911?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22920911", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22920911", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.22920911", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22920911/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22920910", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/22920910", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22920910", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.22920910", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22920911/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22920911/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22920911/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22920911/media-files", "thumbnails": {"10": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22920911:Zeta7%20(3).pdf/full/%5E10,/0/default.jpg", "50": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22920911:Zeta7%20(3).pdf/full/%5E50,/0/default.jpg", "100": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22920911:Zeta7%20(3).pdf/full/%5E100,/0/default.jpg", "250": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22920911:Zeta7%20(3).pdf/full/%5E250,/0/default.jpg", "750": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22920911:Zeta7%20(3).pdf/full/%5E750,/0/default.jpg", "1200": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22920911:Zeta7%20(3).pdf/full/%5E1200,/0/default.jpg"}, "archive": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22920911/files-archive", "archive_media": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22920911/media-files-archive", "latest": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22920911/versions/latest", "latest_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/22920911/latest", "versions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22920911/versions", "draft": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22920911/draft", "access_links": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22920911/access/links", "access_grants": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22920911/access/grants", "access_users": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22920911/access/users", "access_request": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22920911/access/request", "access": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22920911/access", "communities": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22920911/communities", "communities-suggestions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22920911/communities-suggestions", "request_deletion": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22920911/request-deletion", "file_modification": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22920911/file-modification", "quota_increase": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22920911/quota-increase", "requests": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22920911/requests"}, "updated": "2026-09-23T16:48:00.570621+00:00", "recid": "22920911", "revision": 4, "files": [{"id": "e3f8409e-db82-45bb-b078-a977a48be2a5", "key": "Zeta7 (3).pdf", "size": 477675, "checksum": "md5:6b7fae049a3f5970a45f51483098b521", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22920911/files/Zeta7%20(3).pdf/content"}}], "swh": {}, "owners": [{"id": "1705449"}], "status": "published", "stats": {"downloads": 254, "unique_downloads": 197, "views": 2115, "unique_views": 1930, "version_downloads": 254, "version_unique_downloads": 197, "version_unique_views": 1930, "version_views": 2115}, "state": "done", "submitted": true}